repository-code: "https://github.com/saranyoubom/t2d-drug-repositioning-mlss"
license: MIT
abstract: "A single-file Python module with checks for pooled co-expression analyses of small designed experiments (for example 3 groups x 4 replicates and about 17 genes): share of the pooled covariance carried by group means, permutation nulls that keep the group means, a within-group coupling test, run structure, treatment-adjusted and ratio-scheme counts. The checks are candidate checks: their calibration in public data is reported in the associated article; whether they improve the conclusions drawn from small experiments has not been tested."
keywords:
  - co-expression network
  - permutation test
  - small experiments
  - benchmark
